  "description": "BODGUY crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C87 H123 N6 O33 Tb7,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.619-5.176 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.91-179.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb7(OH)6(CO3)3(sach)3(sachH)3(MeOH)6]·3MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
